sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant UI as Study Mode UI (src/app/(app)/study/[id]/page.tsx)
    participant StudyRouter as Study Router (app/routers/study.py)
    participant ContentSvc as Content Service (app/services/content.py)
    participant TutorSvc as AI Tutor Service (app/services/tutor.py)
    participant RAG as RAG Vector Search (app/services/rag.py)
    participant MasterySvc as Mastery Engine (app/services/mastery.py)
    participant DB as Database (attempts, submissions, mastery)

    Student->>UI: Selects Topic (e.g., Binary Search Trees)
    UI->>StudyRouter: POST /api/v1/study/sessions {topic_id}
    StudyRouter->>DB: Query current skill mastery for topic
    StudyRouter->>MasterySvc: target_difficulty(current_mastery)
    MasterySvc-->>StudyRouter: "easy" / "medium" / "hard"
    StudyRouter->>DB: Fetch diagnostic Question matching topic & difficulty
    StudyRouter->>DB: Create Attempt record (mode='study', status='in_progress')
    StudyRouter-->>UI: Step 1: Render Diagnostic Question

    Student->>UI: Submits Answer + Confidence (1-5 scale)
    UI->>StudyRouter: POST /api/v1/study/sessions/{id}/answer {answer, confidence, time_taken_ms}
    StudyRouter->>DB: Create Submission & Verdict records
    StudyRouter-->>UI: Verdict (Correct / Incorrect)

    UI->>StudyRouter: GET /api/v1/study/sessions/{id}/teaching?kind=explanation
    StudyRouter->>TutorSvc: teach_topic(topic, kind='explanation')
    TutorSvc->>RAG: search(topic.name, k=4)
    RAG-->>TutorSvc: Grounded Chunks [S1, S2, ...]
    TutorSvc->>TutorSvc: Call LLM with ExplainOut schema + Guardrails
    TutorSvc-->>StudyRouter: Explanation with Key Points & Citations
    StudyRouter-->>UI: Step 2: Render RAG-Grounded Explanation

    UI->>StudyRouter: GET /api/v1/study/sessions/{id}/teaching?kind=worked_example
    StudyRouter->>TutorSvc: teach_topic(topic, kind='worked_example')
    TutorSvc->>RAG: search(topic.name + " worked example", k=4)
    RAG-->>TutorSvc: Relevant Problem Chunks
    TutorSvc->>TutorSvc: Call LLM with WorkedExampleOut schema
    TutorSvc-->>StudyRouter: Worked Example with Step-by-Step Reasoning
    StudyRouter-->>UI: Step 3: Render Worked Example

    Student->>UI: Completes Follow-Up Mini-Quiz
    UI->>StudyRouter: POST /api/v1/study/sessions/{id}/complete
    StudyRouter->>MasterySvc: update_mastery(SkillState, Evidence)
    Note over MasterySvc: Bayesian/Elo update formula:<br/>delta = lr * w * (target - mastery)<br/>lr = max(0.15, 1/(n+2))<br/>Clipped to ±15.0 pts
    MasterySvc-->>StudyRouter: Updated SkillState (new mastery_score, accuracy)
    StudyRouter->>DB: UPSERT INTO mastery TABLE
    StudyRouter->>DB: Update attempt.status = 'completed'
    StudyRouter-->>UI: Render Session Summary & New Mastery Bar
